connecting-dialog-access-denied = No permission to write to the data folder "{ $path }". Choose another folder in the settings or run the launcher as administrator.
connecting-dialog-download-stalled = The download stopped receiving data. Check your internet connection or try disabling your VPN/proxy, then connect again. Already downloaded files will be kept.
connecting-dialog-files-progress = { $downloaded } / { $total } files
connecting-dialog-retrying = Connection lost, retrying download (attempt { $attempt } of { $max })... Already downloaded files are kept.
